WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:12.344
"This is bad!" Eddy said.

2
00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:19.308
"I can't drive!"

3
00:00:19.309 --> 00:00:25.976
"Me neither!" Dipper cried.

4
00:00:25.977 --> 00:00:30.571
"What will we do?"

5
00:00:30.572 --> 00:00:37.536
Ms. Fender came over.

6
00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:45.040
She gasped. "Water is not for cars!"

7
00:00:45.041 --> 00:00:47.795
"We're sorry!" Dipper said.

8
00:00:47.796 --> 00:00:50.594
"Now we're stuck!"

9
00:00:50.595 --> 00:00:55.395
Ms. Fender sighed.

10
00:00:55.396 --> 00:01:01.055
"I'll get help," she said.

11
00:01:01.056 --> 00:01:07.133
A small boat arrived.

12
00:01:07.134 --> 00:01:13.231
"I'm Toots," she said.

13
00:01:13.232 --> 00:01:24.544
Toots pushed everyone onto the sand.

14
00:01:24.545 --> 00:01:28.303
"Stay on land," Toots said.

15
00:01:28.304 --> 00:01:35.311
"Water is not for cars."

16
00:01:35.312 --> 00:01:39.381
The cars still couldn't drive.

17
00:01:39.382 --> 00:01:45.427
"Your engines are wet," Ms. Fender said.

18
00:01:45.428 --> 00:01:49.921
"The sun will dry them."

19
00:01:49.922 --> 00:01:57.917
Soon Eddy's engine was dry.

20
00:01:57.918 --> 00:02:03.639
The others could drive too.

21
00:02:03.640 --> 00:02:11.814
Everyone drove back to school.

22
00:02:11.815 --> 00:02:16.438
"What did you learn today?" Ms. Fender asked.

23
00:02:16.439 --> 00:02:19.787
"Water is fun," Dipper said.

24
00:02:19.788 --> 00:02:27.024
"But it is not for cars!"

